 >HEAD

   DATAID="MASKZ2"
   ACQBY="AusMT test fixture"
   PROSPECT="Impedance block length fixture"
   LOC="Fixture"
   LAT=-18.443
   LONG=127.665
   ELEV=  0.00

 >INFO   MAXLINES=1000

   MINTED FIXTURE - NOT CUSTODIAN DATA. The defect it carries was measured on
   the seventeen files of halls-creek-2000 in the AusMT GDS staging at
   GDS/_staging/surveys - reference shape
   halls-creek-2000/transfer_functions/edi/ALD40.edi - where the fabricated
   impedance blocks declare the section's NFREQ but carry fewer values than
   that. mt_metadata fails the whole file on the resulting broadcast refusal
   and the station is lost with its real tipper. No byte is copied from a
   staged file: the identity is invented and the tipper values are minted for
   this test. Here the section declares six frequencies and the four ZYY
   blocks carry four values.

 >=DEFINEMEAS

   MAXCHAN=5
   MAXRUN=999
   MAXMEAS=99999
   UNITS=M
   REFTYPE=CART
   REFLAT=-18.443
   REFLONG=127.665
   REFELEV=  0.00

 >HMEAS ID= 1001.001 CHTYPE=HX X =  .000000  Y =  .000000  AZM =  .000000
 >HMEAS ID= 1002.001 CHTYPE=HY X =  .000000  Y =  .000000  AZM=  90.0000
 >HMEAS ID= 1003.001 CHTYPE=HZ X =  .000000  Y =  .000000  AZM=  .000000

 >=MTSECT
  SECTID=MASKZ2
   NFREQ=    6
   HX = 1001.001
   HY = 1002.001
   HZ = 1003.001

 >!****FREQUENCIES****!
 >FREQ NFREQ=  6  ORDER=INC //  6
    0.16276E-04    0.20345E-04    0.24414E-04    0.32552E-04    0.40690E-04    0.48828E-04
 >!****IMPEDANCES****!
 >ZXXR //  6
0 0 0 0 0 0
 >ZXXI //  6
0 0 0 0 0 0
 >ZXX.VAR //  6
0 0 0 0 0 0
 >ZXYR //  6
1 1 1 1 1 1
 >ZXYI //  6
1 1 1 1 1 1
 >ZXY.VAR //  6
1 1 1 1 1 1
 >ZYXR //  6
1 1 1 1 1 1
 >ZYXI //  6
1 1 1 1 1 1
 >ZYX.VAR //  6
1 1 1 1 1 1
 >ZYYR //  6
0 0 0 0
 >ZYYI //  6
0 0 0 0
 >ZYY.VAR //  6
0 0 0 0
 >!****TIPPER PARAMETERS****!
 >TXR.EXP ROT=0.0 //  6
    0.63956E-01    0.11577E+00    0.14710E+00    0.81407E-01    0.57683E-01    0.25813E-01
 >TXI.EXP ROT=0.0 //  6
   -0.21400E-01   -0.34200E-01   -0.41100E-01   -0.29700E-01   -0.18300E-01   -0.11900E-01
 >TXVAR.EXP ROT=0.0 //  6
    0.10000E-01    0.10000E-01    0.10000E-01    0.10000E-01    0.10000E-01    0.10000E-01
 >TYR.EXP ROT=0.0 //  6
    0.11400E+00    0.92000E-01    0.71000E-01    0.48000E-01    0.31000E-01    0.19000E-01
 >TYI.EXP ROT=0.0 //  6
    0.83000E-01    0.71000E-01    0.62000E-01    0.44000E-01    0.29000E-01    0.17000E-01
 >TYVAR.EXP ROT=0.0 //  6
    0.10000E-01    0.10000E-01    0.10000E-01    0.10000E-01    0.10000E-01    0.10000E-01

 >END
